                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">Once per game, a Deffkopta with a Bigbomm may make a special attack, even if it has turbo boosted that turn. Place the large blast template with the central hole on a model that the Deffkopta has passed over during its Movement phase. The Bigbomm scatters D6" and is resolved with Strength 4 and AP 5.</characteristic>
